<title>USA: Union Electric refinances preferred stock.</title>
<headline>Union Electric refinances preferred stock.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Electric Corp said Monday it will redeem on January 21, 1997, the outstanding shares of its preferred stock, $7.44 series, $6.30 series, and $5.50B series.</p>
<p>Union Electric provides energy services to 1.2 million customers in Missouri and Illinois.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
